    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d537">

                <pb facs="0940" n="844" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg844"/>

                <head>No. 535.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General SicMes to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation in Spain</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-10-27"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 27, 1873</date>.
                        (Received November 14.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 782]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The official gazette of this date publishes
                    the decree, a copy and translation of which are inclosed herewith, announcing
                    the visit of the minister of ultramar to Cuba and Porto Rico. The preamble
                    contains an interesting statement of the motives and objects of the mission, to
                    which I beg to invite your attention.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c,</p>
                <closer><signed>D. E. SICKLES.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d537-a1.xml" xpointer="d537-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
